3
00:18:31,764 --> 00:18:37,764
Based on a real WWII vet and family man turned bank robber.

4
00:24:42,352 --> 00:24:48,352
Disillusioned by his post war circumstances, Eddie Boyd is torn between the need to provide for
his young family and an unfulfilled dream to head to Hollywood to become a star.

5
