12
01:14:07,058 --> 01:14:13,058
Citizen Gangster is a 2011 Canadian biographical drama film
directed and written by Nathan Morlando.

13
01:20:17,647 --> 01:20:23,647
Scott Speedman stars as Canadian gangster and
alleged murderer Edwin Alonzo Boyd.

14
01:26:28,235 --> 01:26:34,235
The film originally premiered at the 2011 Toronto International Film Festival under the
title Edwin Boyd, but was retitled Citizen Gangster in general release.

15
01:32:38,823 --> 01:32:44,823
The film explores themes of police brutality, toronto,
canada, bus driver, prison escape, true crime.

16
01:38:49,411 --> 01:38:55,411
The tone is dark and emotional.
